          "scope": "RECONSTRUCTION OF COLUMBIA STREET AREA PHASE II HAS BEEN DEVELOPED IN COORDINATION WITH NYCDEP BED-768B.  IT INCLUDES ALL THE STREETS IN THAT PROJECT SOUTH OF HAMILTON AVE AND ALSO INCLUDES A SERIES OF STREETS IN THE NEIGHBORHOOD REQUIRING CAPITAL RECONSTRUCTION.   PROPOSED WORK INCLUDES FULL RECONSTRUCTION OF SEVERAL BLOCKS ALONG WITH STREETSCAPE AND SAFETY IMPROVEMENTS AT A SERIES OF INTERSECTIONS.  THE OVERALL PURPOSE OF THIS PROJECT IS TO BRING THE STREETS IN THIS AREA TO A STATE OF GOOD REPAIR IN CONJUNCTION WITH UTILITY REPLACEMENT AND TO PROVIDE SAFETY ENHANCEMENTS AT KEY LOCATIONS.",
